                                                "sense_id": "c75848ba-3e97-32c7-8637-ae02674bed2d",
                                                "text": "Doctor Watson roomed with Sherlock Holmes at Baker Street."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f722f6c2-fe86-44cc-be90-f842459dc5a4",
                                                "sense_id": "c75848ba-3e97-32c7-8637-ae02674bed2d",
                                                "text": "Even without looking up, I knew right away who it was. It was Robert Ackley, this guy that roomed right next to me."
